    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prolog">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> Prolog</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Her is geswutelod on þisum gewrite, hu Eadgar cyncg wæs smeagende, hwæt to bote mihte æt þam færcwealme, þe his leodscype swyðe drehte ⁊ wanode, wide gynd his anweald.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Notification is hereby given in this order, that King Eadgar has been considering what remedy could be found for the plague which has greatly afflicted and reduced his people throughout the length and breadth of his kingdom.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Her is geswutelod on þisum gewrite, hu Eadgar cyningc wæs smeagende, hwæt to bote mihte æt ðæm færcwealme, ðe his leodscipe swyðe drehte ⁊ wanode wide gynd his anweald.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
